00:01:42.580 --> 00:01:45.910
Let me introduce the new four Metarex bosses.

00:01:45.910 --> 00:01:48.960
The ruthless tactician, Pale Bay Leaf!

00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:52.670
The invincible muscleman, Yellow Zelkova!

00:01:52.670 --> 00:01:56.300
The beautiful aristocrat, Black Narcissus!

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:57.590
And...

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:03.140
The genius scientist with a 300 I.Q, Dr. Eggman!

00:02:11.810 --> 00:02:17.820
You can relax and leave Sonic to me.

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:28.540
Dr. Eggman.

00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:29.790
What?

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:33.170
You shouldn't act so arrogant.

00:02:33.170 --> 00:02:34.420
Why?

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:38.010
If you act like a big shot, it might backfire during battle.

00:02:38.470 --> 00:02:39.760
Bring it, Eggman!

00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:43.720
Take this!

00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:47.890
Oh my!

00:02:49.560 --> 00:02:51.020
Get it?

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:52.360
Really?

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:55.320
The nail that sticks out gets hammered.

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:57.240
Then what should I do?

00:02:57.240 --> 00:02:58.280
Well...

00:02:58.280 --> 00:03:01.070
Please take care of me, boss.

00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:03.070
How nice.

00:03:01.450 --> 00:03:03.070
Thank you!

00:03:03.070 --> 00:03:07.080
Please let me know if I do anything to offend you.

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:10.620
Nice shot!

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:13.540
I have to do that?

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:14.500
Yes!

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:18.510
It's not easy to act like a minion.

00:03:18.510 --> 00:03:19.880
We know...

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:21.760
Listen!

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:26.760
The battle the other day was fantastic.

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:30.770
Sonic is currently hiding in this area.

00:03:30.770 --> 00:03:35.770
That area has electromagnetic wave distortions, so communication is impossible.

00:03:35.770 --> 00:03:41.530
I see. They're repairing their spaceship since it was damaged in battle.

00:03:43.490 --> 00:03:47.160
This is our best chance to defeat Sonic.

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:49.580
Go, four Metarex bosses!

00:03:50.540 --> 00:03:54.290
I'm interested to know which one of you succeeds.

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:57.300
Everything is for tranquility and order!

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:02.260
Leave this to me!

00:04:02.260 --> 00:04:04.680
Let's go!

00:04:14.980 --> 00:04:18.940
I should've said that I didn't approve of you right then and there.

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:24.410
You made too many mistakes.

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:28.700
We also take hostages, but we don't hurt them.

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:30.580
That's not cool!

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:33.620
You shouldn't build things like that either.

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:35.580
It's illegal!

00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:37.540
Furthermore...

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:40.000
I don't think so!

00:04:41.550 --> 00:04:44.630
Bokkun Kick!

00:04:47.510 --> 00:04:49.930
Don't underestimate us, idiot!

00:04:51.060 --> 00:04:57.230
You made another mistake. They're also my bodyguards.

00:04:57.230 --> 00:05:01.360
I will never approve of you!

00:05:01.690 --> 00:05:05.030
I haven't made my decision yet.

00:05:05.030 --> 00:05:08.990
It has nothing to do with whether I work with you guys or not.

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:13.290
What's your vision of an ideal universe?

00:05:13.290 --> 00:05:16.750
What are you fighting for?

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:21.000
I know it's more than the Chaos Emerald or Planet Egg.

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:23.090
What's beyond that?

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:27.010
How strange that you want to talk about this with me.

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:32.270
I also have my own vision of an ideal universe!

00:05:32.270 --> 00:05:35.180
I understand what you're saying.

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:42.780
You're wondering if our vision of an ideal universe is the same as yours.

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:45.280
I have a question for you in return.

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:48.870
If our visions are different, do you think you can wipe us out?

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:51.990
You're pretty confident.

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:56.790
Que sera, sera!

00:05:58.900 --> 00:06:03.900
Episode 71

00:05:58.900 --> 00:06:03.900
Café Chaotix

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:23.020
Thanks for waiting!

00:06:31.820 --> 00:06:35.290
You didn't think I could play the piano?

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:41.630
Did you forget that my hobby is playing in a band?

00:06:41.630 --> 00:06:46.710
Anyway, you want to know why we're working here?

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:48.800
Okay, I'll tell you.

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:52.140
After parting with Sonic and his friends...

00:06:54.470 --> 00:06:58.890
Make the next right if you want to take the expressway.

00:07:02.440 --> 00:07:10.240
Espio, I won't give them a single cent because they're so hard-headed that they won't extend my credit!

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:13.700
In other words, you don't like paying any money.

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:15.910
Then go in any direction you want, except right.

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:26.250
That looks like a secret path.

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:28.380
It's not on the map.

00:07:28.380 --> 00:07:29.920
Sounds like fun!

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:35.140
Checking out strange places is our job!

00:07:35.140 --> 00:07:36.220
That's our job!

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:56.160
What's going on?

00:08:04.420 --> 00:08:07.670
And we crash landed on this planet.

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:09.090
Huh?

00:08:09.090 --> 00:08:12.010
C'mon, it's no big deal.

00:08:10.170 --> 00:08:12.010
Umm, but...

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:13.840
What's up, Charmy?

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:16.050
This customer wants us to put it on his tab.

00:08:16.050 --> 00:08:17.220
Tab?

00:08:17.220 --> 00:08:18.260
That's fine, right?

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:23.770
Dear customer, you can get a tab once we form a wonderful bond of friendship.

00:08:23.770 --> 00:08:25.480
But Vector, you just said-

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:29.190
I can't remember that far into the past.

00:08:29.190 --> 00:08:32.070
Umm, I'll pay you tomorrow...

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:35.950
Tomorrow? That's too far into the future!

00:08:36.370 --> 00:08:38.030
Thank you...

00:08:38.030 --> 00:08:39.660
Come again!

00:08:40.950 --> 00:08:43.660
How long are you planning to keep this up?

00:08:43.660 --> 00:08:45.920
Until we save enough to pay for repairs.

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:48.920
Just a little longer.

00:08:49.380 --> 00:08:50.840
Welcome!

00:08:52.800 --> 00:08:54.630
Eggman!

00:08:54.630 --> 00:08:56.220
Vector?

00:08:56.220 --> 00:08:58.850
Why did you come here?

00:08:58.850 --> 00:09:00.600
I'm looking for someone.

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:01.390
What?

00:09:03.390 --> 00:09:05.730
Who are you looking for?

00:09:05.730 --> 00:09:07.860
Do you have a picture?

00:09:17.110 --> 00:09:19.780
It's Sonic!

00:09:19.780 --> 00:09:22.620
I want to put this poster up in your store.

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:25.000
He's not hiring us for a job.

00:09:25.290 --> 00:09:29.500
I don't mind, but why are you in charge of putting up posters?

00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:30.880
Because of this.

00:09:32.050 --> 00:09:33.550
What's that?

00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:36.380
That's why you're amateurs.

00:09:36.380 --> 00:09:40.720
I somehow became one of the four Metarex bosses.

00:09:40.720 --> 00:09:42.640
Well, that doesn't matter.

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:44.850
Hurry up and put up the posters!

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:44.850
Right!

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:51.440
Don't put it there! That will hurt my business!

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:54.110
Put it somewhere less noticeable!

00:09:54.110 --> 00:09:55.820
Less noticeable?

00:09:57.780 --> 00:10:00.450
How about under the table?

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:08.080
Water.

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:10.500
Sorry, but we're out of water.

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:13.090
So that's how you're going to treat me.

00:10:13.090 --> 00:10:15.010
Dr. Eggman.

00:10:15.010 --> 00:10:19.640
If you find Sonic, you contact me immediately. Understand?

00:10:19.640 --> 00:10:23.810
Sorry, but it's not our policy to help criminals.

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:25.810
We're going to the next store!

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:26.890
Okay!

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:28.060
Yeah!

00:10:33.110 --> 00:10:36.990
What are we going to do? Are we going to tell Sonic?

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:38.200
Of course.

00:10:38.990 --> 00:10:41.530
What? Eggman?

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:44.660
I'm glad we were upstairs.

00:10:44.660 --> 00:10:51.750
Yeah. If the Metarex fleet find out that we're on this planet and attack, we don't stand a chance.

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:58.090
Eggman is horrible!

00:10:58.090 --> 00:11:02.470
What are you going to do, Sonic? You can't go outside.

00:11:02.470 --> 00:11:04.430
Who do you think I am?

00:11:10.350 --> 00:11:14.480
But we have to buy parts and bring them back.

00:11:18.650 --> 00:11:21.160
Sonic and the others are late.

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:22.950
Yeah.

00:11:22.950 --> 00:11:26.080
As long as I don't make any blunders, they won't find me.

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:29.000
But that won't work at the cash register!

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:32.460
Excuse me?

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:36.090
Oh, that's right. I can't go shopping.

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:40.590
That's a problem. I wonder if there's a solution.

00:11:43.680 --> 00:11:46.140
I'll do the shopping.

00:11:46.810 --> 00:11:48.430
Really?

00:11:48.430 --> 00:11:52.310
Yeah, our business also offers shopping.

00:11:55.690 --> 00:11:59.610
But we only have enough money to pay for the parts. We can't pay you.

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:04.410
Don't be so formal. We're friends, after all.

00:12:04.410 --> 00:12:05.740
I'll put it on your tab.

00:12:05.740 --> 00:12:06.780
That's right!

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:09.750
Thank you. Please buy this.

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:24.180
We can fix our ship with this part...

00:12:27.010 --> 00:12:30.390
No! What am I thinking?

00:12:35.730 --> 00:12:44.070
2 ultra alloy bearings, 10 cans of quantum battery oil and 1 anti-gravity child seat.

00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:46.700
Calling Bay Leaf.

00:12:51.700 --> 00:12:54.000
I see. Just as I thought.

00:12:54.290 --> 00:12:56.290
My prediction was correct.

00:12:56.290 --> 00:13:00.050
When they finish their repairs and lift off, we'll launch an all-out attack!

00:13:16.230 --> 00:13:18.110
We've finished putting up the posters.

00:13:18.730 --> 00:13:21.320
That was hard work!

00:13:21.320 --> 00:13:23.950
What is it, Dr. Eggman?

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:28.410
It's nothing. Let's go!

00:13:28.410 --> 00:13:29.950
Okay!

00:14:09.870 --> 00:14:12.160
They almost found me.

00:14:12.580 --> 00:14:14.500
Welcome back, Vector.

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:15.330
Yeah!

00:14:18.670 --> 00:14:21.500
Let's carry the stuff inside.

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:22.630
Okay!

00:14:25.510 --> 00:14:28.300
Sonic and the others are late.

00:14:28.300 --> 00:14:29.800
Yeah.

00:14:37.440 --> 00:14:38.980
This is the last one.

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:41.810
Let's have Tails come and pick these up.

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:46.240
Wait! They might be monitoring our communications.

00:14:46.240 --> 00:14:50.620
Then what are we going to do? Carry these ourselves?

00:14:51.530 --> 00:14:53.700
I'll take you there.

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:54.910
Are you sure?

00:14:54.910 --> 00:14:57.120
Yeah, but I'll put it on your tab.

00:15:03.590 --> 00:15:06.130
Here we go!

00:15:06.130 --> 00:15:08.670
Vector, are you here?

00:15:08.670 --> 00:15:10.220
It's Eggman!

00:15:11.220 --> 00:15:14.180
Why does he show up now?

00:15:14.180 --> 00:15:16.810
Talk about super bad timing!

00:15:16.810 --> 00:15:19.060
I told him he was a nuisance!

00:15:19.060 --> 00:15:21.560
Wait here! I'll shoo him away!

00:15:23.360 --> 00:15:26.400
Didn't you see the sign outside?

00:15:26.780 --> 00:15:30.910
I came because you didn't have many customers. You should be thankful.

00:15:30.910 --> 00:15:32.570
How rude!

00:15:32.570 --> 00:15:34.280
He's messing around!

00:15:34.280 --> 00:15:36.120
Leave now.

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:38.500
You're not going to treat me to a drink?

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:39.790
Why should I?

00:15:39.790 --> 00:15:44.540
To commemorate my victory over Sonic in our recent battle.

00:15:44.540 --> 00:15:46.800
That's enough!

00:15:46.800 --> 00:15:51.180
Sonic must be gritting his teeth in frustration.

00:15:51.180 --> 00:15:55.390
No, he wouldn't even have the energy to do that. He must be depressed.

00:15:56.220 --> 00:16:00.940
That's what he gets for being overconfident.

00:16:01.310 --> 00:16:03.650
How dare he talk like that!

00:16:03.650 --> 00:16:04.860
Yeah!

00:16:04.860 --> 00:16:06.190
Right, Sonic?

00:16:22.210 --> 00:16:23.710
This drink is on me.

00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:28.250
Is he serious?

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:30.340
I thought he was gonna chase him away!

00:16:30.340 --> 00:16:32.880
Furthermore, he's treating him to a drink!

00:16:32.880 --> 00:16:38.930
It's fine. Eggman rarely beats us anyway.

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:49.110
The Metarex should let me handle this alone, but nooooo!

00:16:49.110 --> 00:16:53.110
They mobilize the other bosses to defeat Sonic.

00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:55.660
Defeat him? Seriously?

00:16:55.660 --> 00:16:59.950
Dead serious. For the tranquil something or whatever.

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:02.660
They act like big shots, but...

00:17:02.660 --> 00:17:09.420
I know Sonic. If he has to be defeated, he would rather lose to me than to them.

00:17:10.880 --> 00:17:13.090
He's saying whatever he wants!

00:17:13.090 --> 00:17:15.300
No one wants to lose to Eggman!

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:23.020
Sorry to bother you.

00:17:23.020 --> 00:17:25.900
No problem, as long as you never come back.

00:17:25.900 --> 00:17:28.860
Humph, I don't want to come back anyway!

00:17:36.660 --> 00:17:38.030
What is it?

00:17:38.030 --> 00:17:41.240
Bad news! It's Bay Leaf's armada!

00:17:41.240 --> 00:17:43.790
Okay, I understand.

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:46.580
Damn that Pale Bay Leaf!

00:17:46.580 --> 00:17:52.760
He must have followed me here and hid his armada behind the moon!

00:17:53.300 --> 00:18:00.100
Even someone as tough as Sonic will be torn to shreds if he leaves this planet.

00:18:02.930 --> 00:18:04.930
That was bad acting.

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:08.310
How did they find out that we're on this planet?

00:18:08.310 --> 00:18:12.820
Eggman just said that they followed him!

00:18:12.820 --> 00:18:16.900
This is bad. Even if we repair the ship, the weapons are still offline.

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:18.700
How can we escape?

00:18:18.990 --> 00:18:20.990
Eggman...

00:18:29.080 --> 00:18:31.750
Come out, Sonic!

00:18:33.380 --> 00:18:36.970
How big is their armada?

00:18:36.970 --> 00:18:38.300
I don't know.

00:18:38.300 --> 00:18:40.550
Can't you use the radar to find out?

00:18:40.550 --> 00:18:46.730
It's impossible. I can use the normal radar, but it can't detect objects behind the moon.

00:18:46.730 --> 00:18:47.890
What should we do?

00:18:47.890 --> 00:18:51.770
Well, we can't stay on this planet forever.

00:18:51.770 --> 00:18:53.230
You're right, but...

00:18:53.230 --> 00:18:56.110
We'll launch as soon as Tails finishes the repairs.

00:18:56.400 --> 00:18:57.950
Do you want to come with us?

00:18:58.240 --> 00:19:01.490
No, count me out. I'm not ready to die.

00:19:09.710 --> 00:19:12.170
Something has launched from the planet!

00:19:12.170 --> 00:19:13.880
Show it on the screen!

00:19:13.880 --> 00:19:14.630
Right!

00:19:24.470 --> 00:19:26.560
It's the Blue Typhoon!

00:19:29.230 --> 00:19:30.850
Get ready to attack!

00:19:36.530 --> 00:19:38.150
Fire!

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:55.340
I did it! I defeated Sonic!

00:19:55.340 --> 00:19:59.510
I have to bring this good news to Dark Oak immediately!

00:20:06.930 --> 00:20:08.560
Thanks for waiting!

00:20:27.910 --> 00:20:30.710
Play it again, Vector.

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:34.000
I told you never to come here again.

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:38.920
I didn't want to come either, but I had nowhere else to go.

00:20:38.920 --> 00:20:42.180
Black vinegar drink and a raw egg.

00:20:42.590 --> 00:20:43.890
What do you want me to do?

00:20:46.890 --> 00:20:48.810
Serve him.

00:20:49.770 --> 00:20:51.100
Are you sure?

00:20:53.100 --> 00:20:55.810
Yeah, and you can put it on his tab.

00:21:14.790 --> 00:21:17.630
Cheers to egg yolk and egg white.

00:21:34.850 --> 00:21:36.690
This is hard work!

00:21:37.360 --> 00:21:40.110
Sheesh, the things we do for him...

00:21:53.200 --> 00:21:56.000
There's no armada behind the moon!

00:21:56.420 --> 00:21:58.840
There's nothing!

00:21:58.840 --> 00:22:04.340
Well, I never believed Eggman in the first place.

00:22:04.340 --> 00:22:08.260
But this is good. If they were actually here, we'd be in big trouble.

00:22:08.260 --> 00:22:09.930
Right, Sonic?

00:22:23.860 --> 00:22:26.530
Thanks, Doctor.

